.TH TOYCMD "1" "November 2026" "Toycmd 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
toycmd \- a demonstration command for iris
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtoycmd\fP [\fIOPTIONS\fP]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-f\fP, \fB\-\-file\fP=\fIPATH\fP
Specify the input configuration file path.
.TP
\fB\-v\fP, \fB\-\-verbose\fP
Enable verbose diagnostics and detailed logging.
.TP
\fB\-q\fP
Suppress standard informational output.
